  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_01",
      "hash64": "EE58D31F07F68497",
      "text": "¿Has conseguido capturar alguna Forma de\\nAlola?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_02",
      "hash64": "EE58D41F07F6864A",
      "text": "Venga, ¡imagínate que estás en Alola!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_03",
      "hash64": "EE58D51F07F687FD",
      "text": "Vaya, este Pokémon no es una Forma de Alola.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_04",
      "hash64": "EE58CE1F07F67C18",
      "text": "¡Eso es! ¡No cabe duda de que esta es la Forma\\nde Alola de [VAR 0x0101(0001)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "EE58CF1F07F67DCB",
      "text": "Este Pokémon concentra sus poderes psíquicos\\nen la cola y se desplaza deslizándose sobre ella.\\r\\n¡Algunos lo llaman el Surfista de Tierra Firme!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_06",
      "hash64": "EE58D01F07F67F7E",
      "text": "Este Pokémon se comunica con sus compañeros\\nmeneando los pelillos metálicos que le crecen en\\r\\nla cabeza.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_07",
      "hash64": "EE58D11F07F68131",
      "text": "Este Pokémon es capaz de detectar sonidos a\\nvarios kilómetros de distancia con los filamentos\\r\\ndorados que le crecen en la cabeza, ya que son\\r\\npotentes sensores.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_08",
      "hash64": "EE58CA1F07F6754C",
      "text": "Este Pokémon es muy caprichoso, egoísta y\\nvoluble, lo que lo hace muy popular entre los\\r\\nEntrenadores a los que les gusta cumplir los\\r\\ncaprichos de sus Pokémon.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_09",
      "hash64": "EE58CB1F07F676FF",
      "text": "Este Pokémon posee una gran fortaleza física,\\nque junto con su cara redonda y su suave pelaje\\r\\nlo hacen muy popular en Alola.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_10",
      "hash64": "EE5C581F07F99C6D",
      "text": "Este Pokémon se introdujo en Alola con el fin\\nde remediar la proliferación de residuos, ¡y su\\r\\naspecto cambió de un día para otro!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_11",
      "hash64": "EE5C571F07F99ABA",
      "text": "Lo que parecen colmillos y uñas de este\\nPokémon son en realidad toxinas cristalizadas\\r\\nque envenenan al contacto, por lo que resulta\\r\\nmuy peligroso.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_12",
      "hash64": "EE5C561F07F99907",
      "text": "El poder dragón de este Pokémon despertó\\ncuando creció tanto que dejó de necesitar su\\r\\npoder psíquico.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_13",
      "hash64": "EE5C551F07F99754",
      "text": "Este Pokémon expulsa aire gélido a -50 ºC,\\ny todavía hay gente que se refiere a él por su\\r\\nantiguo nombre: Keo-Keo.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_14",
      "hash64": "EE5C541F07F995A1",
      "text": "A este Pokémon, capaz de producir cristales\\nde hielo en su pelaje, lo veneraban como la\\r\\nencarnación de una deidad que moraba en las\\r\\nmontañas nevadas.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_15",
      "hash64": "EE5C531F07F993EE",
      "text": "Este Pokémon habita en montañas de nieves\\nperpetuas y, aunque tiene un caparazón de hielo\\r\\nduro como el acero, su tripa es blanda.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_16",
      "hash64": "EE5C521F07F9923B",
      "text": "Este Pokémon ha desarrollado unas garras\\nrobustas y afiladas para moverse mejor por\\r\\nla nieve y atravesarla a gran velocidad.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_17",
      "hash64": "EE5C511F07F99088",
      "text": "El cuerpo de este Pokémon es roca magnetizada,\\ny presenta depósitos de arena ferruginosa en los\\r\\npuntos donde se intensifica el campo magnético.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_18",
      "hash64": "EE5C501F07F98ED5",
      "text": "Este Pokémon rebosa electricidad gracias a las\\nrocas de las que se alimenta y es muy propenso\\r\\na pelearse.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_19",
      "hash64": "EE5C4F1F07F98D22",
      "text": "Este Pokémon es un cascarrabias y un obstinado\\nque, cuando se harta, descarga electricidad por\\r\\ntodo el cuerpo y emite un rugido atronador.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_01",
      "hash64": "CE97A87B27A6F75A",
      "text": "¿Cómo? ¡¿Ya has conseguido uno?![VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_01",
      "hash64": "49B42BEA169DA8EB",
      "text": "¡Me ha costado un montón!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_select_02",
      "hash64": "49B42CEA169DAA9E",
      "text": "Ha sido pan comido",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_02",
      "hash64": "CE97A77B27A6F5A7",
      "text": "Conque capturar Pokémon se te da tan bien\\ncomo combatir con ellos...[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_03",
      "hash64": "CE97A67B27A6F3F4",
      "text": "Veo que en la Academia Naranja tenéis muy\\nbuen nivel.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_04",
      "hash64": "CE97A57B27A6F241",
      "text": "Veo que en la Academia Uva tenéis muy\\nbuen nivel.[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0049"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_20",
      "hash64": "EE5FBE1F07FC7F96",
      "text": "¡Muy bien! ¡Escuchadme todos!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_21",
      "hash64": "EE5FBF1F07FC8149",
      "text": "Ha dado la hora, así que se acabó la clase\\npor hoy.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_teacher_22",
      "hash64": "EE5FBC1F07FC7C30",
      "text": "Si no habéis conseguido ningún Pokémon durante\\nla clase, tendréis que atrapar uno como deberes.\\c\\n¡Nos vemos!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_mob_01",
      "hash64": "9A95444F99F3B847",
      "text": "¿Deberes? Jooo...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0080_fairybb_05",
      "hash64": "CE97A47B27A6F08E",
      "text": "¿Qué te ha parecido la clase, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0049)]",
